## Detailed Remediation Summary by Layer

### 1. `packages/shared` — Contracts, Types & Build System
* **Dual ESM/CJS Distribution**: Refactored [package.json](file:///c:/aamir_all_files/anti-online-judge/packages/shared/package.json), [tsconfig.json](file:///c:/aamir_all_files/anti-online-judge/packages/shared/tsconfig.json), and created [tsconfig.esm.json](file:///c:/aamir_all_files/anti-online-judge/packages/shared/tsconfig.esm.json). Emits CJS in `dist/cjs` for Node.js backends and pure ESM in `dist/esm` for Vite/Rollup tree-shaking.
* **Canonical Problem Difficulty**: Defined [ProblemDifficulties](file:///c:/aamir_all_files/anti-online-judge/packages/shared/src/types/index.ts) `as const` and `ALL_PROBLEM_DIFFICULTIES`, unifying Mongoose enums, Zod validation, and TypeScript types into a single source of truth.
* **Frozen Verdict Arrays**: Configured [verdicts.ts](file:///c:/aamir_all_files/anti-online-judge/packages/shared/src/constants/verdicts.ts) with `Object.freeze` on `ALL_VERDICTS` (`readonly Verdict[]`), preventing runtime array mutation.
* **Decoupled Language Configurations**: In [languages.ts](file:///c:/aamir_all_files/anti-online-judge/packages/shared/src/constants/languages.ts), separated `LanguageExecutionConfig` from `LanguageUIConfig`.
* **Live Sample Runner Contracts**: Added strong types (`ISampleCaseResult`, `ISampleRunResponse`, `RunSampleInput`) to [types/index.ts](file:///c:/aamir_all_files/anti-online-judge/packages/shared/src/types/index.ts) and [submission.schema.ts](file:///c:/aamir_all_files/anti-online-judge/packages/shared/src/validation/submission.schema.ts).
* **NIST-Compliant Passwords**: Updated [auth.schema.ts](file:///c:/aamir_all_files/anti-online-judge/packages/shared/src/validation/auth.schema.ts) to require 8+ characters with mixed alphanumeric characters and sanitized full names against non-printable characters.
* **Memory-Safe Output Normalization**: Added a 1MB memory safety cap (`MAX_NORMALIZE_SIZE_BYTES`) to [diffOutput.ts](file:///c:/aamir_all_files/anti-online-judge/packages/shared/src/utils/diffOutput.ts) and expanded test cases in [diffOutput.test.ts](file:///c:/aamir_all_files/anti-online-judge/packages/shared/src/utils/diffOutput.test.ts).

### 2. `apps/worker` — Execution Sandbox & Reliability
* **Shell Injection & Output Flooding Prevention**: Hardened [runner.sh](file:///c:/aamir_all_files/anti-online-judge/apps/worker/docker/runner.sh) with a strict `$LANG` allowlist (`cpp` | `python`), numeric validation on `TIME_LIMIT_MS`, output size cap (64KB) on stdout, and safely quoted binary execution.
* **Zombie Container Leak Protection**: In [dockerRunner.ts](file:///c:/aamir_all_files/anti-online-judge/apps/worker/src/sandbox/dockerRunner.ts), assigned unique deterministic container names (`oj-run-...`), and added explicit `docker kill` / `docker rm -f` cleanup handlers in timeout and exception blocks.
* **Base-10 Metric Parsing**: Changed `parseInt(val, 16)` to `parseInt(val, 10)` in [dockerRunner.ts](file:///c:/aamir_all_files/anti-online-judge/apps/worker/src/sandbox/dockerRunner.ts).
* **Zero-Metric Anomaly Sentinel**: Added a sentinel check in [evaluator.ts](file:///c:/aamir_all_files/anti-online-judge/apps/worker/src/sandbox/evaluator.ts) to classify zero-metric runs as `INTERNAL_ERROR` rather than a false `WRONG_ANSWER`.
* **Idempotency & Double-Count Guard**: In [submissionWorker.ts](file:///c:/aamir_all_files/anti-online-judge/apps/worker/src/queue/submissionWorker.ts), guarded against re-evaluating non-PENDING submissions and ensured `acceptedSubmissions` increments only on the initial `PENDING -> ACCEPTED` transition.
* **Dead Letter Queue (DLQ) Compensation**: Handled retry exhaustion in [submissionWorker.ts](file:///c:/aamir_all_files/anti-online-judge/apps/worker/src/queue/submissionWorker.ts) so permanently failed jobs update their database record to `INTERNAL_ERROR`.
* **Startup Readiness & Process Handlers**: In [worker.ts](file:///c:/aamir_all_files/anti-online-judge/apps/worker/src/worker.ts), added a Redis `ping()` check during startup, registered global `unhandledRejection` and `uncaughtException` listeners, and properly awaited `redisClient.quit()`.

### 3. `apps/server` — Express REST API & Database
* **Route Shadowing Fixed**: Reordered [submission.routes.ts](file:///c:/aamir_all_files/anti-online-judge/apps/server/src/routes/submission.routes.ts) so `/run`, `/user/:userId`, and `/problem/:problemId` are registered **before** wildcard `/:id`.
* **Strict Startup Environment Validation**: In [env.ts](file:///c:/aamir_all_files/anti-online-judge/apps/server/src/config/env.ts), added strict Zod startup validation for all environment variables, requiring a secure `JWT_SECRET` (min 16 chars).
* **BOLA / IDOR Authorization Protection**: In [submission.controller.ts](file:///c:/aamir_all_files/anti-online-judge/apps/server/src/controllers/submission.controller.ts), enforced strict ownership checks in `getSubmissionById` (returning `403 Forbidden` for non-owners).
* **Submission Rate Limiting & Queue Flood Defense**: In [submission.routes.ts](file:///c:/aamir_all_files/anti-online-judge/apps/server/src/routes/submission.routes.ts) and [submission.controller.ts](file:///c:/aamir_all_files/anti-online-judge/apps/server/src/controllers/submission.controller.ts), added a dedicated evaluation rate limiter and blocked duplicate concurrent `PENDING` submissions for the same problem.
* **Live Sample Runner Endpoint**: Implemented `POST /api/submissions/run` with [submission.controller.ts](file:///c:/aamir_all_files/anti-online-judge/apps/server/src/controllers/submission.controller.ts) accepting `RunSampleInput` and returning live evaluation results (`ISampleRunResponse`) with actual outputs and diff metrics.
* **ReDoS Protection & Pagination Bounds**: In [problem.controller.ts](file:///c:/aamir_all_files/anti-online-judge/apps/server/src/controllers/problem.controller.ts), escaped search queries against regex catastrophic backtracking and clamped pagination limits between 1 and 50.
* **N+1 Query Elimination in `getMe`**: Replaced in-memory loops in [auth.controller.ts](file:///c:/aamir_all_files/anti-online-judge/apps/server/src/controllers/auth.controller.ts) with an optimized MongoDB aggregation pipeline.
* **Compensating Rollbacks & Database Indexes**: Added compensation transactions on queue failure in [submission.controller.ts](file:///c:/aamir_all_files/anti-online-judge/apps/server/src/controllers/submission.controller.ts), and compound indexes `{ user: 1, problem: 1 }` and `{ user: 1, verdict: 1 }` in [Solution.ts](file:///c:/aamir_all_files/anti-online-judge/apps/server/src/models/Solution.ts).

### 4. `apps/client` — Frontend Architecture & UI
* **Real "Run Samples" Integration**: Connected "Run Samples" in [ProblemDetailPage.tsx](file:///c:/aamir_all_files/anti-online-judge/apps/client/src/pages/ProblemDetailPage.tsx) to `POST /api/submissions/run`, displaying live outputs, execution timings, and pass/fail diffs.
* **Unmount-Safe Polling**: Added `isMountedRef` protection in [ProblemDetailPage.tsx](file:///c:/aamir_all_files/anti-online-judge/apps/client/src/pages/ProblemDetailPage.tsx) to eliminate memory leaks, and added a 30s timeout handler with informative user feedback.
* **Global Error Boundary**: Implemented [ErrorBoundary.tsx](file:///c:/aamir_all_files/anti-online-judge/apps/client/src/components/ErrorBoundary.tsx) and wrapped the root application in [main.tsx](file:///c:/aamir_all_files/anti-online-judge/apps/client/src/main.tsx).
* **Hook Stability & Callback Optimization**: Wrapped callbacks (`loadPastSubmissions`, `openAuthModal`, `login`, `register`, `logout`) in `useCallback` across [ProblemDetailPage.tsx](file:///c:/aamir_all_files/anti-online-judge/apps/client/src/pages/ProblemDetailPage.tsx) and [AuthContext.tsx](file:///c:/aamir_all_files/anti-online-judge/apps/client/src/context/AuthContext.tsx).
* **Form State Reset**: In [AuthModal.tsx](file:///c:/aamir_all_files/anti-online-judge/apps/client/src/components/AuthModal.tsx), cleared form inputs on mode switches and modal close.
* **Dropdown Outside-Click**: In [Navbar.tsx](file:///c:/aamir_all_files/anti-online-judge/apps/client/src/components/Navbar.tsx), added `mousedown` and `Escape` listeners for reliable menu closing on desktop and touch devices.
* **Custom CSS Design System Alignment**: In [VerdictBadge.tsx](file:///c:/aamir_all_files/anti-online-judge/apps/client/src/components/VerdictBadge.tsx), replaced broken Tailwind classes with CSS custom properties (`var(--verdict-ac)`, etc.).
* **Search Input Debouncing**: Added a 300ms debounce in [HomePage.tsx](file:///c:/aamir_all_files/anti-online-judge/apps/client/src/pages/HomePage.tsx) to eliminate API hammering.
* **Live Health Check Badge**: Connected [Navbar.tsx](file:///c:/aamir_all_files/anti-online-judge/apps/client/src/components/Navbar.tsx) to `/health` with a 60s poll.
* **Accessibility (a11y)**: Added `htmlFor`, `aria-label`, `aria-expanded`, `role="dialog"`, and `aria-modal="true"` attributes across all interactive components.

